  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "がんばりやな　せいしつで　ゆうめい。\nたいえきを　はなで　ふくらませた\nバルーンを　てきに　ぶつける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "노력하는 성질로 유명하다.\n체액을 코로 부풀린\n풍선을 적에게 부딪힌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "因勤奮的性格而聞名。\n會用鼻子將體液吹成氣球，\n然後扔向敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Connu pour son tempérament de battant,\nil rassemble l’eau de son corps au bout de son\nmuseau en un ballon qu’il projette sur l’ennemi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon ist für seine Willensstärke\nbekannt. Bläst es Körperflüssigkeit durch die\nNase, entsteht eine Blase, die als Waffe fungiert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se le conoce por su diligencia y predisposición.\nSegrega agua por la nariz para hinchar globos\ncon los que golpea a sus rivales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È conosciuto per la sua forza di volontà.\nLancia sul nemico dei palloncini pieni d’acqua\nche gonfia con il naso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon snorts body fluids from its nose,\nblowing balloons to smash into its foes.\nIt’s famous for being a hard worker.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頑張り屋な　性質で　有名。\n体液を　鼻で　膨らませた\nバルーンを　敵に　ぶつける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "因为勤奋的性格而有名。\n用鼻子将体液吹成气球，\n扔向敌人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se le conoce por su diligencia y predisposición.\nSegrega agua por la nariz para hinchar globos\ncon los que golpea a sus rivales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みずの　バルーンを　あやつる。\nおおきな　バルーンを　つくるため\nコツコツ　れんしゅうを　くりかえす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물로 된 풍선을 조종한다.\n커다란 풍선을 만들기 위해\n꾸준히 연습을 반복한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "操縱水做的氣球。\n為了製造大大的氣球，\n孜孜不倦地反復練習。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon fabrique des ballons remplis d’eau\npour se battre. Il ne peut produire un gros ballon\nqu’au prix d’un entraînement rigoureux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kontrolliert Wasserblasen. Um eine große\nBlase zu erschaffen, muss es unermüdlich üben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Maneja con soltura los globos de agua que crea,\npero, para poder hacer uno bien grande,\nnecesita practicar sin descanso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Crea dei palloncini d’acqua che controlla\nnella lotta. Si allena costantemente per riuscire\na produrre palloni di grandi dimensioni.",
